# NOTE: src/convex/_generated is deliberately NOT ignored.
# src/convex/payments.ts, src/convex/users.ts and src/pages/buyer/BuyerWallet.tsx
# import these generated types, so `tsc -b` fails on Netlify/Vercel if the files
# are missing from the repo. Commit them (run `bun convex dev --once` locally to
# refresh after changing the Convex schema).